---
/**
 * Wishlist: full trip cards (price, Book now) for the trips saved with the heart,
 * kept in this browser. Share the list, ask about all of them on WhatsApp in one
 * message, clear it (with undo). Popular trips are suggested when it is empty.
 * All cards are rendered at build time; the script shows the saved ones in saved order.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import RecentTrips from '../components/RecentTrips.astro';
import TripCard from '../components/TripCard.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { alternates, url, type Lang } from '../i18n/routes';
import { t } from '../i18n/ui';
import { contact, site } from '../config';
import { getTrips } from '../lib/trips';

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const s = t(lang);
const m = s.more;
const L = <T,>(o: Record<Lang, T>) => o[lang];
const c = L({
  en: { intro: 'Trips you saved with the heart. They are kept in this browser only, nothing is sent to us.', saved: 'Saved trips', empty: 'No saved trips yet', emptyText: 'Tap the heart on any trip to keep it here and compare later.' },
  fr: { intro: 'Les voyages enregistrés avec le cœur. Ils restent dans ce navigateur, rien ne nous est envoyé.', saved: 'Voyages enregistrés', empty: 'Aucun voyage enregistré', emptyText: 'Touchez le cœur sur un voyage pour le garder ici et comparer plus tard.' },
  es: { intro: 'Los viajes que guardó con el corazón. Se quedan solo en este navegador; no se nos envía nada.', saved: 'Viajes guardados', empty: 'Aún no ha guardado viajes', emptyText: 'Toque el corazón de cualquier viaje para guardarlo aquí y compararlo después.' },
  de: { intro: 'Reisen, die Sie mit dem Herz gespeichert haben. Sie bleiben nur in diesem Browser, nichts wird an uns gesendet.', saved: 'Gespeicherte Reisen', empty: 'Noch keine gespeicherten Reisen', emptyText: 'Tippen Sie bei einer Reise auf das Herz, um sie hier zu sammeln und später zu vergleichen.' },
  pt: { intro: 'As viagens que guardou com o coração. Ficam apenas neste navegador; nada nos é enviado.', saved: 'Viagens guardadas', empty: 'Ainda não guardou viagens', emptyText: 'Toque no coração de qualquer viagem para a guardar aqui e comparar mais tarde.' },
  ar: { intro: 'الرحلات التي حفظتموها بالقلب. تبقى في هذا المتصفح فقط ولا يُرسل إلينا شيء.', saved: 'الرحلات المحفوظة', empty: 'لا توجد رحلات محفوظة بعد', emptyText: 'اضغطوا على القلب في أي رحلة لحفظها هنا ومقارنتها لاحقا.' },
});
const trips = await getTrips();
const featured = trips.filter((tr) => tr.data.featured).slice(0, 3);
const info = Object.fromEntries(trips.map((tr) => [tr.id, { title: tr.data.title[lang], url: new URL(url(lang, 'trips', tr.id), site.url).href }]));
---
<Base lang={lang} title={s.nav.wishlist} description={c.intro} alternates={alternates('wishlist')} noindex>
  <PageHeader lang={lang} title={s.nav.wishlist} intro={c.intro} path={url(lang, 'wishlist')} />

  <div class="container-page" data-wish-page
    data-info={JSON.stringify(info)} data-wa={contact.whatsapp}
    data-s={JSON.stringify({ count: m.wishCount, shareText: m.wishShareText, askText: m.wishAskText, copied: m.wishCopied, cleared: m.wishCleared, undo: m.wishUndo })}>

    <!-- Toolbar (shown when the list has trips) -->
    <div class="wish-bar card mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 p-4 sm:p-5" data-wish-bar hidden>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold"><Icon name="heart" class="text-accent-text" /><span data-wish-count></span></p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-whatsapp !min-h-11 text-sm" data-wish-ask><Icon name="whatsapp" size={18} /> {m.wishAsk}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost !min-h-11 text-sm" data-wish-share><Icon name="share" size={18} /> {m.wishShare}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost !min-h-11 text-sm" data-wish-clear><Icon name="x" size={18} /> {m.wishClear}</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mb-6" data-wish-status></div>

    <h2 class="sr-only">{c.saved}</h2>
    <ul class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-wish-grid>
      {trips.map((trip) => <li data-wish-item={trip.id} hidden><TripCard trip={trip} lang={lang} level="h3" /></li>)}
    </ul>

    <!-- Empty state + suggestions -->
    <div data-wish-empty hidden>
      <div class="card flex flex-col items-center p-10 text-center">
        <span class="grid size-16 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent/15 text-accent-text"><Icon name="heart" size={32} /></span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-h3">{c.empty}</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-ink-2">{c.emptyText}</p>
        <a href={url(lang, 'trips')} class="btn btn-brand mt-6">{s.common.seeAll}</a>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-14 text-h2">{m.wishSuggest}</h2>
      <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {featured.map((trip) => <li><TripCard trip={trip} lang={lang} level="h3" /></li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <RecentTrips lang={lang} />
</Base>

<script>
  import { getWishlist } from '../scripts/wishlist';
  import { syncHearts } from '../scripts/wishlist';

  const page = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-wish-page]');
  if (page) {
    const info: Record<string, { title: string; url: string }> = JSON.parse(page.dataset.info!);
    const s = JSON.parse(page.dataset.s!);
    const grid = page.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-wish-grid]')!;
    const bar = page.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-wish-bar]')!;
    const empty = page.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-wish-empty]')!;
    const status = page.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-wish-status]')!;
    const countEl = page.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-wish-count]')!;
    const items = new Map([...grid.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-wish-item]')].map((li) => [li.dataset.wishItem!, li]));
    const list = () => getWishlist().filter((id) => items.has(id));

    const render = () => {
      const ids = list();
      items.forEach((li, id) => (li.hidden = !ids.includes(id)));
      ids.forEach((id) => grid.append(items.get(id)!)); // saved order, newest first
      bar.hidden = ids.length === 0;
      empty.hidden = ids.length > 0;
      countEl.textContent = s.count.replace('{n}', String(ids.length));
    };
    const lines = () => list().map((id) => `• ${info[id].title}\n  ${info[id].url}`);
    const say = (text: string, action?: { label: string; run: () => void }) => {
      const p = Object.assign(document.createElement('p'), { className: 'inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-surface-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm', textContent: text });
      if (action) {
        const b = Object.assign(document.createElement('button'), { type: 'button', className: 'link font-semibold', textContent: action.label });
        b.addEventListener('click', () => { action.run(); status.replaceChildren(); });
        p.append(b);
      }
      status.replaceChildren(p);
    };

    page.querySelector('[data-wish-ask]')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const text = [s.askText, '', ...lines()].join('\n');
      window.open(`https://wa.me/${page.dataset.wa}?text=${encodeURIComponent(text)}`, '_blank', 'noopener');
    });
    page.querySelector('[data-wish-share]')!.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const text = [s.shareText, '', ...lines()].join('\n');
      if (navigator.share) {
        try { await navigator.share({ title: document.title, text }); } catch {}
        return;
      }
      window.open(`https://wa.me/?text=${encodeURIComponent(text)}`, '_blank', 'noopener');
    });
    page.querySelector('[data-wish-clear]')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const before = getWishlist();
      try { localStorage.setItem('wishlist', '[]'); } catch {}
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('wishlistchange'));
      say(s.cleared, {
        label: s.undo,
        run: () => {
          try { localStorage.setItem('wishlist', JSON.stringify(before)); } catch {}
          window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('wishlistchange'));
        },
      });
    });

    render();
    window.addEventListener('wishlistchange', () => { render(); syncHearts(); });
    window.addEventListener('storage', render);
  }
</script>
